---
title: Quantity Compound Scale
portions: 2
---

## Dough ->&dough

Mix @flour{1 cup + 1 tbsp} with @sugar{1/2 cup - 2 tbsp} and @=salt{1 tsp + 1 pinch}.

Add @milk{1 cup + 1-2 tbsp} and @butter{1 cup + 20 g}.

Squeeze @juice{100 ml}<@oranges{1 lb + 4 oz}.

## Bake

Shape &dough{1 kg + 200 g} on a tray.
